 		return -EFAULT;
 
+	/*
+	 * Only the head of the VP assist page matters to KVM
+	 * (nested_control / enlighten_vmentry / current_nested_vmcs all
+	 * live in the first 56 bytes).  Reading the full 4k page on
+	 * every nested VMRUN is a measurable per-transition cost; the
